{"question_text": {"৪৯তম বিসিএস ⎯ গণিত (৫৫১)": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) What is the degree (মাত্রা) of the differential equation <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_QO7VWPW.png\" width=\"391\" height=\"91\"><br>", "option1": "1<br>", "option2": "2<br>", "option3": "3<br>", "option4": "0<br>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_wqTG19n.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) What is the order (ক্রম) of the differential equation <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_nNBJyLC.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"90\"><br>", "option1": "1<br>", "option2": "2<br>", "option3": "3<br>", "option4": "0<br>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_kCpd5Ki.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) Which is Linear (রৈখিক) differential equation?<br>", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_rhVbnAt.png\"><br>", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_AdGog0H.png\"><br>", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip2_H3kr8tM.png\"><br>", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip3_Mx7u0M5.png\"><br>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>The equation will be called linear differential equation if, it is of first degree in the dependent variable and its partial derivatives and product of the dependent variable and its derivatives must be absent.</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) Which is non-Linear (অরৈখিক) differential equation?<br>", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_X4FVzfY.png\"><br>", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_l9BNLkT.png\"><br>", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip2_25W8lJG.png\"><br>", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip3_sJTAQrU.png\"><br>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>The equation will be called linear differential equation if, it is of first degree in the dependent variable and its partial derivatives and product of the dependent variable and its derivatives must be absent. If the equation is not linear, then its non-linear.</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) What is the general solution of ln(dy/dx) = ax + by ?<br>", "option1": "be<sup>ax</sup> +  ae<sup>bx</sup> + A = 0<br>", "option2": "be<sup>ax</sup> +  ae<sup>- bx</sup> + A = 0<br>", "option3": "be<sup>ax</sup> -  ae<sup>- bx</sup> + A = 0<br>", "option4": "be<sup>- ax</sup> +  ae<sup>- bx</sup> + A = 0<br>", "answer": "0", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_2KAkyIm.png\" width=\"535\" height=\"434\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) What is the general solution of dy/dx = 2x ?<br>", "option1": "y = 2x<sup>2</sup> + c<br>", "option2": "y = 2x + c<br>", "option3": "y = x<sup>2</sup> + c<br>", "option4": "y = x<sup>3</sup> + c<br>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip5_ysSdr4m.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) What is the general solution of dy/dx = y/x ?<br>", "option1": "y = cx<br>", "option2": "x = c<br>", "option3": "x = y<br>", "option4": "x = cy<br>", "answer": "0", "exp": "<p>সঠিক উত্তর: ক) y = cx ও ঘ) x = cy<br>অপশনে দ্বৈত উত্তর থাকায় প্রশ্নটি বাতিল করা হয়েছে।<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip5_hV224Jj.png\"><br>বিপরীতভাবে, y = cx ও সঠিক। </p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) What is the general solution of <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_vq9rco8.png\"><br>", "option1": "sin<sup>- 1</sup>x - sin<sup>- 1</sup>y = c<br>", "option2": "cos<sup>- 1</sup>x + cos<sup>- 1</sup>y = c<br>", "option3": "sin<sup>- 1</sup>x + sin<sup>- 1</sup>y = c<br>", "option4": "cos<sup>- 1</sup>x - cos<sup>- 1</sup>y = c<br>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/%E0%A7%A7%E0%A7%AE.PNG\" width=\"662\" height=\"145\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) What is the general solution of ydx - xdy = xydx?<br>", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip2_gMNYpyt.png\"><br>", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip3_yJVpeoJ.png\"><br>", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip4_OPYG39X.png\"><br>", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip5_dN9IoZ1.png\"><br>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_Tlv2W1b.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) What is the general solution of <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_2AoKqk3.png\" width=\"293\" height=\"71\"> <br>", "option1": "sin(x + y) + sec(x + y) = x + c<br>", "option2": "tan(x - y) - sec(x - y) = x + c<br>", "option3": "tan(x + y) - sin(x + y) = x + c<br>", "option4": "tan(x + y) - sec(x + y) = x + c<br>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip5_lMAUYgE.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) What is the general solution of y(1 + xy)dx + x(1 - xy)dy = 0?<br>", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip3_HN7xD9I.png\"><br>", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip2_1201QjE.png\"><br>", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip4_dtStlvb.png\"><br>", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip5_LT7oJuc.png\"><br>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip6_7tgV3I6.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) What is the general solution of (x + y) (dx - dy) = (dx + dy)?<br>", "option1": "x - y = ln(x + y) + c<br>", "option2": "x - y = ln(2x + y) + c<br>", "option3": "x + y = ln(x + y) + c<br>", "option4": "x - y = ln(x + 2y) + c<br>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip5_VUtOtw6.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/31_9gvXiHW.PNG\" width=\"468\" height=\"70\" alt=\"\"><br>", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_MLOl9dT.png\"><br>", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip3_HBMA02F.png\"><br>", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip4_BOf9E1t.png\"><br>", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip6_4gdNvS0.png\"><br>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/32_l3aOq0x.PNG\" width=\"694\" height=\"173\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) What is the general solution of (2x - y + 1)dx + (2y - x - 1)dy = 0?<br>", "option1": "x<sup>2</sup> + x - xy + y<sup>2</sup> + y = c<br>", "option2": "x<sup>2</sup> + x - xy + y<sup>2</sup> - y = c<br>", "option3": "x<sup>2</sup> + x - xy - y<sup>2</sup> - y = c<br>", "option4": "x<sup>2</sup> - x - xy + y<sup>2</sup> - y = c<br>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip6_vvkUlew.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) What is the I.F (integrating factor) of <br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_Cb9QHLc.png\" width=\"334\" height=\"80\"><br>", "option1": "e<sup>sinx</sup><br>", "option2": "e<sup>cotx</sup><br>", "option3": "e<sup>secx</sup><br>", "option4": "e<sup>tanx</sup><br>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip5_dYkgF5d.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) What is the general solution of <br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_6oaJdhi.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"81\"><br>", "option1": "ye<sup>3x</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + c<br>", "option2": "ye<sup>3x</sup> = 2x<sup>3</sup> + c<br>", "option3": "ye<sup>3x</sup> = x<sup>3/2</sup> + c<br>", "option4": "ye<sup>3x</sup> = x<sup>3</sup> + c<br>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip6_wRD4Y0L.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) What is the general solution of <br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_nPB5WF1.png\" width=\"422\" height=\"68\"><br>", "option1": "3y(1 + x<sup>2</sup>) = x<sup>2</sup> + c<br>", "option2": "3y(1 + x<sup>2</sup>) = 4x<sup>3</sup> + c<br>", "option3": "3y(1 + x<sup>2</sup>) = x<sup>3/2</sup> + c<br>", "option4": "3y(1 + x<sup>2</sup>) = x<sup>3</sup> + c<br>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip10.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) What is the general solution of <br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_IGZ6J5W.png\"><br>", "option1": "yx<sup>n</sup> = 2ax + c<br>", "option2": "yx<sup>n - 1</sup> = ax + c<br>", "option3": "yx<sup>n</sup> = ax<sup>2</sup> + c<br>", "option4": "yx<sup>n</sup> = ax + c<br>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip6_9nILCkJ.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_pUYDLt6.png\" width=\"748\" height=\"82\"><br>", "option1": "2x<br>", "option2": "x<br>", "option3": "x<sup>2</sup><br>", "option4": "2x<sup>2</sup><br>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip5_ES5KlA0.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_VMxpoNF.png\" width=\"723\" height=\"80\"><br>", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_t4BiP86.png\" width=\"95\" height=\"63\"><br>", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip2_bULoHvV.png\" width=\"91\" height=\"64\"><br>", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip3_MtXRvqR.png\" width=\"92\" height=\"61\"><br>", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip4_fPxoxeo.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"65\"><br>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/24_xebGmbg.PNG\" width=\"516\" height=\"183\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "21", "question": "২১) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_Imn1GQL.png\"><br>", "option1": "1/x<br>", "option2": "2/x<br>", "option3": "e<sup>x</sup><br>", "option4": "e<sup>x/2</sup><br>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip6_c8yW3Ma.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "22", "question": "২২) What is the general solution of <br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_Kue2FlG.png\" width=\"285\" height=\"84\"><br>", "option1": "y(1 + lnx + cx) = 1<br>", "option2": "y(1 + lnx - cx) = 1<br>", "option3": "(1 + lnx + cx) = 1<br>", "option4": "(1 + lnx - cx) = 1<br>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip5_0bFJOYD.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "23", "question": "২৩) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_LgwhVqJ.png\" width=\"962\" height=\"86\"><br>", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_al0YInp.png\" width=\"43\" height=\"81\"><br>", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip2_xYWrFf7.png\" width=\"43\" height=\"87\"><br>", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip3_LeqxHpd.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"69\"><br>", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip4_xjH0DLU.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"70\"><br>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip5_Svz4lZs.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "24", "question": "২৪) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_JvKpeOn.png\"><br>", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_dKuSJj7.png\"><br>", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip2_7MBTzSz.png\"><br>", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip3_ogmCtwP.png\"><br>", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip4_iQV5bLj.png\"><br>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip5_yYUsO9V.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "25", "question": "২৫) What is the general solution of (D<sup>2</sup> + D - 6)y = 0?<br>", "option1": "Ae<sup>3x</sup> + Be<sup>2x</sup><br>", "option2": "Ae<sup>3x</sup> + Be<sup>- 2x</sup><br>", "option3": "Ae<sup>- 3x</sup> + Be<sup>- 2x</sup><br>", "option4": "Ae<sup>- 3x</sup> + Be<sup>2x</sup><br>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>(D<sup>2</sup> + D - 6)y = 0<br>⇒ m<sup>2</sup> + m - 6 = 0<br>⇒ m = - 3, 2<br><br>So, y = Ae<sup>- 3x</sup> + Be<sup>2x</sup></p>"}, {"id": "26", "question": "২৬) What is the general solution of (D<sup>2</sup> - 4D + 4)y = 0?<br>", "option1": "(A + Bx)e<sup>2x</sup><br>", "option2": "Ae<sup>2x</sup> + Be<sup>2x</sup><br>", "option3": "Ae<sup>2x</sup><br>", "option4": "Ae<sup>-3x</sup> + Be2x<br>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>(D<sup>2</sup> - 4D + 4)y = 0<br>⇒ m<sup>2</sup> - 4m + 4 = 0<br>⇒ m = 2, 2</p>\r\n<p>So, y = (A + Bx)e<sup>2x</sup></p>"}, {"id": "27", "question": "২৭) What is the general solution of (D<sup>2</sup> - 4D + 13)y = 0?<br>", "option1": "Ae<sup>2x</sup> + Be<sup>- 3x</sup><br>", "option2": "(A + Bx)e<sup>2 ± 3i</sup><br>", "option3": "(Acos3x - Bsin3x)e<sup>2x</sup><br>", "option4": "(Acos3x + Bsin3x)e<sup>2x</sup><br>", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip5_lS6azHf.png\"></p>"}, {"id": "28", "question": "২৮) What is the general solution of (D<sup>3</sup> - 5D<sup>2 </sup>+ 7D - 3)y = 0?<br>", "option1": "Ae<sup>x</sup> + Be<sup>3x</sup><br>", "option2": "(A + Bx)e<sup>3x</sup> + Ce<sup>x</sup><br>", "option3": "(A + Bx)e<sup>x</sup> + Ce<sup>3x</sup><br>", "option4": "(Acosx + Bsin3x)<br>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>(D<sup>3</sup> - 5D<sup>2</sup> + 7D - 3)y = 0<br>⇒ m<sup>3</sup> - 5m<sup